; The backdrop is referenced as an ext_resource, NOT as an inline CompressedTexture2D with a
; `load_path` into res://.godot/imported/. It used to be the latter, and the hash baked into that
; path (…-a2f1c527…) no longer matched what the importer produces (…-8c23e349…), so the sprite
; silently rendered nothing on every machine: .godot/ is gitignored, so the path is a per-clone
; build artifact and nothing on disk keeps the two in step.
